cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt these workshop materials, please cite them as below."
title: "CODE-M Workshop: Genome-Scale Metabolic Modelling"
abstract: >-
  Slides, Jupyter notebooks, helper code and model files for a three-day
  hands-on workshop on genome-scale metabolic models with Python (cobrapy):
  flux balance analysis, model reconstruction (by hand and with ModelSEED),
  model quality (MEMOTE), FVA and pFBA, gene essentiality, strain design and
  omics integration.
authors:
  - family-names: Del Carratore
    given-names: Francesco
  - family-names: Chapman
    given-names: Stephen
license:
